  "bodyHash": "d972ac0fe094b499",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>Cobblemon: Create Industries &ndash; Cobblemon 與 Create 整合模組</strong></span></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>精靈球 3D 模型</strong></h3>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_7103db05-076d-4ae7-a546-39b6ce15ee20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"467\" height=\"399\"></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Cobblemon: Create Industries</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Cobblemon: Create Industries 使用 Create 的機制，為 Cobblemon 物品添加了自動化合成配方與工業化生產流程。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模組旨在讓遊戲進度更具沉浸感，讓玩家能透過機器、加工設備與自動化生產線來製造精靈球等物品。</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">目前功能：<br><br></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">◽ <strong>精靈球製造：</strong><br>使用 Create 的機器與自動化系統生產精靈球。配方已重新設計，以在 Cobblemon 中提供更具沉浸感與工業化的進度體驗。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">◽ <strong>精靈球蓋子製作：</strong><br>精靈球蓋子可透過 Create 設備進行機械加工製造。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">◽ <strong>古代精靈球：</strong><br>古代精靈球也可利用自動化與機械加工系統進行製作。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">◽ <strong>精靈糖果：</strong><br>透過工業化流程製作不同類型的糖果，用於強化與進化你的精靈。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">◽ <strong>麻糬：</strong><br>使用與 Create 機制完全整合的自動化配方來生產麻糬。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">◽ <strong>Cobblemon 藥水：</strong><br>利用混合、加工設備與 Create 機械來實現藥水生產的自動化。<br><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">所有內容皆已與 Create 的自動化與加工系統整合。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">如果你喜歡自動化、工廠經營與 Cobblemon，這模組正是為了提升你的遊玩體驗而打造。<br><br></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>所需模組：<br></strong></span></span><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\"><em>◽ <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></span><br>◽ <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a><br>◽<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemore-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemore Lib</a><br><br></span></em></span></h3>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">精靈球合成</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_1107a900-da72-4bf9-8a6c-ab86bc819715.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"362\" height=\"298\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_30454f16-19b8-4e55-95e4-2f9af6cdbec2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"362\" height=\"298\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_c6c57e03-dd92-49aa-a52f-671e7e446cfb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"362\" height=\"298\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_bf3bb923-b88d-46cf-ab30-aa7db85f1cc0.png\" width=\"348\" height=\"288\"><br><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_e730723f-c59b-4d34-8ae4-6b4af36c986c.png\" width=\"362\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">糖果合成</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_36dfef0e-9dd7-4e6c-afc1-87f358444ab9.png\" width=\"362\" height=\"298\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_db06a442-67a4-402a-8bb6-f1621a4d284b.png\" width=\"362\" height=\"298\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_9585ef51-399d-41a7-8010-20e48a6c9be9.png\" width=\"362\" height=\"298\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_a6418073-c49a-45c5-9de6-e6b82f441f15.png\" width=\"362\" height=\"298\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">我的其他模組：</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-cobblemon-industries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_bc53f78d-303b-42ba-8cf1-432880111c6b.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-simple-pokecenters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_a06ced40-ba05-41b8-b825-2c04d21b1daa.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-egg-spawner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_874907dd-1c16-4623-a8e1-b250fa69d933.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-simple-smart-healer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_ef5fb44c-113e-4fe6-a208-3542c670447c.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-poke-labs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_a1a0d1aa-1c16-461c-896b-f6c3a456c046.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-mekanism-industries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_26c495f1-de71-4b09-996c-215e2b525d05.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_4852adae-28a3-4ef0-80a8-0d59fe2eec14.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></p>",
